# Commands

- `create-task.tsx` — Form-based task creation
- `my-tasks.tsx` — List view of assigned tasks
- `planned.tsx` — Planned/upcoming tasks view

Shared patterns in `src/shared.tsx`:

- API fetch helpers with preference-based API key
- Type definitions matching Arca API responses
- Raycast List/Form/ActionPanel idioms
- Priority colors, status categories, done filtering

Follow `@raycast/api` conventions for List items, Actions, and Toast feedback.
